<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Select by Point Normal</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p>This command is accessible from <span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Select &gt; Scan Data &gt; By Point Normal</b></span>.</p>
<p class="description"><span lang="EN-GB" class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">Sometimes scanning on steep angle to the surface produces low quality data. Call</span> <span class="Command">Select By Point Normal</span> <span lang="EN-GB">to select part of a visible scan based on the angle at which the points were scanned.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="Images/select_point_normal.gif" width="257px" height="165px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><i style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB">Alpha</span></i></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Is the angle between surface normal and the sensor. Default value is 60 degrees.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB">Selected are those points where <i>alpha</i> is greater than the value in</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Select Points</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">dialog, which means that sensor was at very steep angle there.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="Commands_files/image306.gif" width="239px" height="133px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command works on scan data only. Note that it removes any previous scan data selections. Other data types remain unaffected.</span></p>
<p class="Use"><span class="Command">Select By Point Normal</span> <span lang="EN-GB">is</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>used</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">to select (and after that remove) poor data generated by scanning at steep angle.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
